{
  "_comment": "Word lists for scripts/lint-copy.mjs. Edit freely. 'hard' fails the check, 'flag' warns with a suggestion, 'weak' warns when overused. Adapted from kai-cmo-harness scripts/quality_gates (MIT) and tuned to knowledge/company.md; see docs/CREDITS.md.",
  "hard": [
    "revolutionary", "revolutionise", "revolutionize", "revolutionising", "revolutionizing",
    "game-changing", "game changing", "game-changer", "game changer",
    "cutting-edge", "cutting edge", "state-of-the-art", "best-in-class", "world-class",
    "seamless", "seamlessly", "synergy", "synergies", "guaranteed", "paradigm shift",
    "utilise", "utilize", "utilising", "utilizing",
    "deep dive", "dive deep", "circle back", "touch base", "low-hanging fruit", "move the needle",
    "at the end of the day", "it's important to note", "it's worth noting", "in today's fast-paced",
    "in today's rapidly evolving", "without further ado", "this comprehensive guide", "in conclusion",
    "first and foremost", "take it to the next level", "next level", "thought leader", "thought leadership",
    "empower", "empowers", "empowering", "transformative", "holistic", "actionable insights",
    "i'd be happy to help", "hope you're well", "hope this finds you well", "just bumping this"
